              "type": "blob_dialog",
              "content": "A fraction is just a way of saying part of something.",
              "metadata": {
                "version": 1,
                "lines": [
                  {
                    "id": "l1",
                    "text": "A fraction is just a way of saying part of something.",
                    "mood": "happy",
                    "cta": "Like what?"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "l2",
                    "text": "Cut a roti into 4 equal pieces and eat 1. You ate one quarter, or 1/4.",
                    "mood": "happy",
                    "cta": "Okay"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "l3",
                    "text": "The bottom number says how many pieces the whole was cut into.",
                    "mood": "thinking",
                    "cta": "And the top?"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "l4",
                    "text": "The top number says how many of those pieces you have. Try it below!",
